00:47:58.060 --> 00:48:00.960
You know, something elapsed.

00:48:01.060 --> 00:48:03.620
This is the way I understand it.

00:48:04.120 --> 00:48:08.120
And I think that if we would teach this to our children,

00:48:09.380 --> 00:48:13.760
they will save a lot of agony, intellectual agony, when they go to study in school.

00:48:15.020 --> 00:48:20.660
But the Quran is not saying in no place that this Yom Echad is just a Yom that we are at the country.

00:48:20.660 --> 00:48:27.640
If you look at it, Azra makes it very clear, even Azra, that this Yom cannot possibly be the regular Yom.

00:48:28.060 --> 00:48:32.300
They cannot be measured according to the normal standards of measurement.

00:48:32.740 --> 00:48:35.680
And this is something that our children sometimes go to school.

00:48:36.120 --> 00:48:39.880
They have enormous difficulties, great questions.

00:48:39.880 --> 00:48:42.660
They go to some other people that they confuse themselves.

00:48:42.660 --> 00:48:45.760
