00:48:46.260 --> 00:48:52.180
So we should tell them, of course, we could accept the traditional interpretation that, for instance, this gentleman mentioned.

00:48:52.620 --> 00:48:52.900
Fine.

00:48:53.220 --> 00:48:56.480
