00:48:56.480 --> 00:48:58.020
It's not what is written in the Perusha.

00:48:58.280 --> 00:48:59.900
It could be corrected in the petition,

00:49:00.220 --> 00:49:01.760
but it's not what is written

00:49:01.760 --> 00:49:03.780
black and white on the Torah.

00:49:04.100 --> 00:49:04.860
The Torah is telling you,

00:49:05.180 --> 00:49:06.940
you want to interpret it this way?

00:49:07.060 --> 00:49:07.740
Please interpret it.

00:49:07.740 --> 00:49:08.580
